 "8a5cd9e41f6c6d3c": {
  "container": null,
  "content": [
   {
    "citations": null,
    "text": "{\"attack_techniques\":[{\"id\":\"T1190\",\"name\":\"Exploit Public-Facing Application\",\"tactics\":[\"Initial Access\"],\"why_relevant\":\"The command injection attack is targeting a public-facing API endpoint to exploit a vulnerability in the web application.\"},{\"id\":\"T1059\",\"name\":\"Command and Scripting Interpreter\",\"tactics\":[\"Execution\"],\"why_relevant\":\"The injected payload executes OS commands (`cat /etc/passwd`) through a command interpreter to retrieve sensitive information.\"},{\"id\":\"T1105\",\"name\":\"Ingress Tool Transfer\",\"tactics\":[\"Command and Control\"],\"why_relevant\":\"The injected command includes `wget malware.sh` to download and retrieve a malicious tool into the compromised system.\"}],\"identity_signals\":null,\"key_findings\":\"A multi-stage command injection attack targeting the admin API endpoint was detected and blocked by WAF-PROD-02. The payload attempted to exfiltrate sensitive system files (/etc/passwd) and download a malicious script via wget. The attack was successfully denied before execution, with no evidence of internal compromise or successful exploitation.\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"severity_rationale\":\"This is a blocked perimeter attack attempt with malicious payload intent (credential theft and malware staging) but no evidence that the WAF denial failed or that any internal system was compromised. The source is external (192.0.2.201), the action was denied, and no identity anomalies were detected. While the payload is sophisticated (multi-stage attack chain), the control functioned as designed.\",\"confidence\":0.92,\"recommended_response\":\"Acknowledge the WAF block and log the incident. Verify WAF-PROD-02 rules are current for command injection patterns. Review access logs for the target API endpoint for the past 24 hours to confirm no similar attempts succeeded. If this source or pattern recurs, consider IP-based rate limiting or geographic blocking. No immediate internal investigation required given the denied action and lack of identity signals.\",\"rounds_used\":0}",
    "type": "text"
   }
  ],
  "diagnostics": null,
