    "citations": null,
    "text": "{\"completeness\": 0.85, \"citation_quality\": 0.9, \"severity_defensibility\": 0.8, \"overall_pass\": true, \"feedback\": \"This is a solid triage that correctly identifies the attack chain and applies appropriate ATT&CK techniques with clear justification. The investigation appropriately recognizes that the WAF successfully blocked the attempt and calibrates severity accordingly\u2014medium is well-defended given the denied action and lack of compromise evidence. The recommended response is proportionate and actionable. Minor areas for enhancement: explicitly document why T1190 applies (public-facing API endpoint exposed to internet), and consider briefly mentioning whether the source IP reputation was checked or if this warrants adding to blocklists. The analysis could also note whether the payload syntax (bash command chain) suggests a specific tool or adversary tradecraft, though this is not critical given the blocked status.\"}",
